. Mother Kundalini, I am not guilty at all.","start":592.62,"end":597.92,"words":[{"text":"So","start":592.62,"end":592.8},{"text":"here","start":592.8,"end":592.94},{"text":"we","start":592.94,"end":593.12},{"text":"can","start":593.12,"end":593.34},{"text":"say,","start":593.34,"end":593.82},{"text":"I","start":593.82,"end":593.86},{"text":"am","start":593.86,"end":594.08},{"text":"not","start":594.08,"end":594.28},{"text":"guilty.","start":594.28,"end":595.08},{"text":"Mother","start":595.56,"end":595.78},{"text":"Kundalini,","start":595.78,"end":596.26},{"text":"I","start":596.26,"end":596.6},{"text":"am","start":596.6,"end":596.76},{"text":"not","start":596.76,"end":596.96},{"text":"guilty","start":596.96,"end":597.16},{"text":"at","start":597.16,"end":597.56},{"text":"all.","start":597.56,"end":597.92}]},{"text":"We can repeat this several times, and we can ask, Mother Kundalini, please awaken in me self-esteem.","start":598.58,"end":635.9,"words":[{"text":"We","start":598.58,"end":598.84},{"text":"can","start":598.84,"end":598.84},{"text":"repeat","start":598.84,"end":599.04},{"text":"this","start":599.04,"end":599.38},{"text":"several","start":599.38,"end":599.62},{"text":"times,","start":599.62,"end":600.58},{"text":"and","start":631.34,"end":631.54},{"text":"we","start":631.54,"end":631.56},{"text":"can","start":631.56,"end":631.98},{"text":"ask,","start":631.98,"end":632.16},{"text":"Mother","start":632.16,"end":632.38},{"text":"Kundalini,","start":632.38,"end":633.28},{"text":"please","start":633.28,"end":633.28},{"text":"awaken","start":633.28,"end":633.76},{"text":"in","start":633.76,"end":634},{"text":"me","start":634,"end":634.38},{"text":"self-esteem.","start":634.78,"end":635.9}]},{"text":"Let me know my own worth and then we can put our right hand on the right side of our head, just above our ear.","start":636.7,"end":671.84,"words":[{"text":"Let","start":636.7,"end":637.1},{"text":"me","start":637.1,"end":637.26},{"text":"know","start":637.26,"en